# Arabic translations for PharmacyOS ERP.
#
# These strings are installed after ERPNext, so they also OVERRIDE upstream ERPNext wording where
# Iraqi pharmacy usage differs. Notably "Batch" is "الوجبة" / "رقم الوجبة" (the term used on Iraqi
# medicine packs and Ministry of Health paperwork) instead of ERPNext's "الدفعات", which reads as
# "payments".
